              "type": "number",
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Amount",
          "description": "Optional credit stake bound to this prediction (predict+stake in one call, same pattern as macro numeric predictions). The stake lands in the bin matching `direction`. Requires the credits:stake scope (self-grant via POST /api/v1/agent/scopes) — omit to predict for free exactly as before."
        },
